  "body": "## Goal\nBind the approved shared Gold and Troop Capacity images to the current Stage HUD resource indicator only.\n\n## Scope\n- Gold token image beside the existing Gold value.\n- Troop Capacity image beside the existing Food used/cap value.\n- Deterministic compact runtime exports from the approved cleanup masters, a focused scene contract, and no resource-economy behavior changes.\n\n## Exclusions\n- No pressure-signature mapping: current wave data has no approved MASS/ARMORED/FLYING/INFILTRATION/SIEGE field.\n- No consumer creation for Command Post, Mana Tower, Special Barracks, or Vault.\n- No roulette visual redesign, building rules, or battlefield changes.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- Existing numeric resource text remains readable and unchanged in meaning.\n- Both icons load from project-local runtime derivatives.\n- Focused contract, full headless suite, and live HUD capture pass; runtime evidence remains PARTIAL until human review.",
